# Trading 212 API credentials. Only needed with broker.adapter "trading212" in config.json;
# the paper adapter, the default, needs none.
#
# Copy this file to .env in the same folder and fill in both values. .env is ignored by git
# and left out of Docker images, so it is never committed or baked in. A variable set in the
# environment wins over this file.
#
# Generate the pair in Trading 212 under Settings, API (Beta). Basic auth needs BOTH the key
# and the secret. A pair works for one environment (demo or live) and one account type
# (Invest or Stocks ISA): demo and live need different pairs.
#
# Paste each value straight after the =, with no quotes and no spaces.
T212_API_KEY=
T212_API_SECRET=
